                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1223bca4-1f6f-33eb-9383-b2f3cab3c92a",
                        "entry_id": "e6702879-2d04-3652-a23c-0e529b55260b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "painted, colored, dyed"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f1f37c1-dad4-4591-8c6a-de1fcb301dbe",
                                "sense_id": "1223bca4-1f6f-33eb-9383-b2f3cab3c92a",
                                "text": "— Вот, что называется, встреча! — повторял он, расширяя заплывшие глаза и выдвигая пухлые губки, над которыми странно и неуместно торчали крашеные усы. — Ай да Баден! Все сюда как тараканы лезут. Как ты сюда попал?",
                                "translation": "'Well, this is something like a meeting!' he repeated, opening wide his sunken eyes, and drawing down his thick lips, over which the straggling dyed moustaches seemed strangely out of place. 'Ah, Baden! All the world runs here like black-beetles! How did you come here, Grisha?'",
                                "english": "'Well, this is something like a meeting!' he repeated, opening wide his sunken eyes, and drawing down his thick lips, over which the straggling dyed moustaches seemed strangely out of place. 'Ah, Baden! All the world runs here like black-beetles! How did you come here, Grisha?'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
